            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.24.18+2CH.24.19+2CH.24.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 24.18-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.11+2CH.36.12+2CH.36.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 36.11-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore te nkiterunoto e nkitoria e Sedekia olayioni le Yosia olaiguanani le Yuda, ele rorei oewuo enetii Yeremia eing'uaa enetii Olaitoriani ejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji aatiaka nanu Olaitoriani: “Ntobiraki kewan nkeenta o enchata oo lmong'i, nipik ninche emurt ino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Irriwaki olkilikuai olaiguanani le Edom, o laiguanani le Moab, o laiguanani le lelo ayiok le Amon, o laiguanani le Turo, o laiguanani le Sidon too nkaik elelo kiliku ooetuo Yerusalem enetii Sedekia olaiguanani le Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchoo ninche ena kitanapata too lkituaak lenye: ‘Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel: ena intae ipupuo aajoki ilkituaak linyi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nanu ilo laa ore te ngolon ai sapuk o te nkaina ai naitoriori oitayio enkop, tenebo iltung'ana o ng'uesi naatii oriong enkop naa kaisho nanu ilo pooki ladol eishiaakino te nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aishooyie taata nanu kuna kuapi pooki apik nkaik e Nebukadnesa, olaiguanani le Babilon, osinka lai, naishoo sii ninye ing'uesi e ong'ata meisiayia ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keisiaai ninye iloreren pooki o layioni lenye o layioni lo layioni lenye ometaba anaa nelotu enkata enkop enye makewan; netum taa nkuapi kumok o laiguanak kituaak aaitaa ninye orrindik.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Kake tenetii ake ninye enkop aashu enkitoria nemeisiaai Nebukadnesa ele aiguanani le Babilon, nepik emurt enye abori enchata olaiguanani le Babilon, naa kaitame nanu ina kop to lalem, o to lameyu o to lmeitai, Olaitoriani ojo, ometaba anaa namut nanu ninye te nkaina enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa emining iloibonok linyi, o ilaitumusumusok linyi, o ilaidetidetak linyi, o lalimunok linyi arashu ilasakutok linyi, lelo oojoki intae, Misiaayiayia olaiguanani le Babilon.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu elejare ina naibonoki ninche intae, aa ore intae naa keyae enelakua aaitung'uaa enkop inyi, naa kaaraa nanu intae aipang'ie, naa eindaayaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ake pooki orere oyau emurt enye apik abori enchata olaiguanani le Babilon aisiaai ninye, napalaki ninche enkop enye, pee etur ninye nebik teine, Olaitoriani ojo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sedekia olaiguanani le Yuda airorie tena oitoi: “Eyautu imurto inyi abori olchata lo laiguanani le Babilon, nisiaayiayia ninye o ltung'ana lenyena pee ipokipoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kainyoo iyie o ltung'ana linono pee iyeye to lalem, o to lameyu o to lmeitai, anaa enairoro Olaitoriani tialo pooki orere lemeisiaai olaiguanani le Babilon? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emining ororei le lelo oibonok oojoki intae, ‘Misiayiayia olaiguanani le Babilon,’ amu elejare ina naibonoki ninche intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eitu nanu airriu ninche, Olaitoriani ojo, kake keibonisho ninche te lejare te nkarna ai, eji ejo kaaraa nanu intae naa eindaayaya, intae o loibonok o lelo oibonok ooibonoki intae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitoki nanu airorie ilapolosak o ltung'ana pooki, ajoki, “Nji ejo Olaitoriani: Emining irorei le lelo oibonok ooibonoki intae, ejo, ‘Ng'ura, keshukuni nena masaa enkaji o Laitoriani aaitasieku aaitung'uaa Babilon,’ amu elejare ina naibonoki ninche intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emining intae ninche; esiaayia olaiguanani le Babilon pee ipokipoko. Kainyoo pee eitaae ena anasa olmuaate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tenaa eloibonok ninche, naa tenaa ketii ororei lo Laitoriani tenebo ninche, nchoo naa ninche esaisho to Laitoriani loo lororani, paa ore nena masaa naatung'uayioki tiatua enkaji o Laitoriani, tiatua enkaji o laiguanani le Yuda, o tiatua Yerusalem nemepuo Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani tialo ng'apeta, o lmoti le nkare, o nkitasheyieta o kulie masaa pooki naatung'uayioki tiatua ena anasa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitu eya Nebukadnesa olaiguanani le Babilon, ina kata apa pee eya te yararoto aitung'uaa Yerusalem aya Babilon Yekonia olayioni le Yehoiakim, olaiguanani le Yuda, o lkituaak pooki le Yuda o Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Enkai e Israel, tialo nena masaa naatung'uayioki tiatua enkaji o Laitoriani o tiatua enkaji o laiguanani le Yuda, o tiatua Yerusalem: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kenapi ninche aaya Babilon netoni teine ometabau ina olong naing'or nanu ninche ashukoki ene wueji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
